        {
            "heading": "Extended historical timeline",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "A subset of mods have tried to create additional historical bookmarks, in an attempt to extend the historical vanilla timeline covered by Paradox games."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The further away from vanilla timeframe and map scope the mod goes, the more mechanics and events need to be adapted or re-written to fit the period or location, and the more major the overhaul needs to be."
